  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place salt and water in a medium saucepan, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Once boiling, add oats, cocoa powder, and maple syrup; whisk to combine. Cover and let simmer, on low, 3-5 minutes, or until oats reach desired consistency."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, wash, trim, and thinly slice strawberries."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide oats between bowls and top with strawberries, almonds, and milk. Enjoy!"
    }
